# Runtime-generated python sizing tools (TOOL-CREATION-ON-THE-FLY).
# These are written here at chain time by tool-generator.ts after a generated
# tool PASSES its self-test, then registered for the run. The durable source of
# truth is the `generated_tools` candidate table in ~/.forge-truth/forge-truth.db
# (DB-first reuse re-writes the .py on demand) — so the .py files themselves are
# scratch and MUST NOT be committed. Keep the directory, ignore its contents.
*.py
!.gitignore
